@startuml PSH 解锁时序
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DCE9FB
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontColor #1F2933
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteFontColor #5C4A00

title PSH 解锁时序（banner → 锁定 → 解锁）

participant "Channel\n(Serial/SSH)" as CH
participant "状态机\nPshStateMachine" as SM
participant "PshHandler" as HD
participant "PSH 设备" as DEV

== 阶段一：banner 判定 ==

DEV --> CH : open() 返回 banner
CH -> SM : start(banner) 匹配 profile
SM --> CH : LOCKED (锁定)

== 阶段二：debug → 密钥 → 解锁 ==

SM -> HD : LOCKED 创建 handler
HD --> CH : unlock() 序列
CH -> DEV : write('debug')
DEV --> CH : read()\n→ Challenge + Password:
CH -> HD : onKeyRequest 获取密钥
HD --> CH : 发送密钥
CH -> DEV : write(密钥)
DEV --> CH : read()\n→ Access Granted
HD --> CH : READY 解锁成功

@enduml
